  "content": {
    "id": "p23-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Find the sums of these arithmetic sequences, whose terms are logarithms.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p23-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$$\\log_a2+\\log_a4+\\log_a8+\\cdots+\\log_a1024$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$55\\log_a2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_a1024&=\\log_a2^{10}\\\\\\log_a1024&=10\\log_a2\\end{align*}$$\nThe first term is $a_1=\\log_a2$, the common difference is $d=\\log_a2$, and the last term is $\\ell=10\\log_a2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a_1+(n-1)d\\\\10\\log_a2&=\\log_a2+(n-1)\\log_a2\\\\10&=1+n-1\\\\n&=10\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}S_{10}&=\\frac{10}{2}(\\log_a2+10\\log_a2)\\\\S_{10}&=5(11\\log_a2)\\\\S_{10}&=55\\log_a2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$$\\log_5 243+\\log_5 81+\\log_5 27+\\cdots+\\log_5\\left(\\frac{1}{243}\\right)$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0$",
          "worked": "$$243=3^5,\\quad81=3^4,\\quad27=3^3,\\quad\\frac{1}{243}=3^{-5}$$\n$$a=5\\log_5 3,\\quad d=-\\log_5 3,\\quad\\ell=-5\\log_5 3$$\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a+(n-1)d\\\\-5\\log_5 3&=5\\log_5 3+(n-1)(-\\log_5 3)\\\\-5&=5-n+1\\\\-5&=6-n\\\\n&=11\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}S_{11}&=\\frac{11}{2}(5\\log_5 3-5\\log_5 3)\\\\S_{11}&=0\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q8-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$$\\log_b36+\\log_b18+\\log_b9+\\cdots+\\log_b\\left(\\frac{9}{8}\\right)$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3(4\\log_b3-\\log_b2)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a&=\\log_b36\\\\a&=2\\log_b2+2\\log_b3\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}d&=\\log_b18-\\log_b36\\\\d&=\\log_b\\left(\\frac{18}{36}\\right)\\\\d&=\\log_b\\left(\\frac12\\right)\\\\d&=-\\log_b2\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\ell&=\\log_b\\left(\\frac98\\right)\\\\\\ell&=2\\log_b3-3\\log_b2\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a+(n-1)d\\\\2\\log_b3-3\\log_b2&=2\\log_b2+2\\log_b3+(n-1)(-\\log_b2)\\\\-3\\log_b2&=2\\log_b2-n\\log_b2+\\log_b2\\\\-3&=3-n\\\\n&=6\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}S_6&=\\frac12(6)\\left(\\log_b36+\\log_b\\left(\\frac98\\right)\\right)\\\\S_6&=3\\left(\\log_b36+\\log_b\\left(\\frac98\\right)\\right)\\\\S_6&=3\\log_b\\left(36\\times\\frac98\\right)\\\\S_6&=3\\log_b\\left(\\frac{81}{2}\\right)\\\\S_6&=3(4\\log_b3-\\log_b2)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 65
      }
    ]
  },
